 * Kerberos 5 "PA ENC TIMESTAMP" by magnum & Dhiru
 *
 * Pcap file -> input file:
 * 1. tshark -r capture.pcapng -T pdml  > ~/capture.pdml
 * 2. krbng2john.py ~/capture.pdml > krb5.in
 * 3. Run john on krb5.in
 *
 * http://www.ietf.org/rfc/rfc4757.txt
